{"id":"36b4649dd248921c","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-absolute.md","title":"Absolute Concept","display":"df-absolute — Absolute Concept","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-absolute","aliases":["58-df-absolute"],"display":"df-absolute — Absolute Concept","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-absolute"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-absolute</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-absolute — Absolute Concept"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> 是规范的纯隶属语言编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in V\">\\(M,N\\in V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subseteq N\">\\(M\\subseteq N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_M,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_M,M)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_N,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_N,N)\\)</span>（规范成员结构，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsoluteSelected}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsoluteSelected}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}selected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbsoluteSelected}_S(\\varphi,M,N,\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nM\\neq\\varnothing\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\\land M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(x\\subseteq M)\n\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;(x\\subseteq N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_N,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\\land\n(\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}selected}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbsoluteSelected}_S(\\varphi,M,N,\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nM\\neq\\varnothing\\land N\\neq\\varnothing\\land M\\subseteq N\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(x\\subseteq M)\n\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;(x\\subseteq N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M_N,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_N,s)\\land\n(\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,s))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AbsoluteSelected}_S(\\varphi,M,N,\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AbsoluteBetween}_S(\\varphi,M,N)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AbsoluteSelected}_S(\\varphi,M,N,\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A formula is absolute between <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> if its truth value is preserved for assignments from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>真值比较同时绑定两份成员结构编码和两份满足递归；三参数写法存在量化全部六个见证，因而不再留下自由结构码或重载谓词元数。</li>\n<li>与真宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的“绝对性”是元理论模式，不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 当作集合编码的一阶结构；本定义因此只量化两个集合论域结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 绝对性需要传递性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 一般只有向上绝对性，不能无条件替换为双向等价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{